{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":3110,"name":"Moming Duan","username":"Moming","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/c6cbf5/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-07-28T08:51:00.351Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi everyone,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI wanted to ask about the current status of the ModelGo license review. The latest resubmission thread is here:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://lists.opensource.org/pipermail/license-review_lists.opensource.org/2025-December/005945.html\"\u003e\n  \u003cheader class=\"source\"\u003e\n\n      \u003ca href=\"https://lists.opensource.org/pipermail/license-review_lists.opensource.org/2025-December/005945.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003elists.opensource.org\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/header\u003e\n\n  \u003carticle class=\"onebox-body\"\u003e\n    \n\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://lists.opensource.org/pipermail/license-review_lists.opensource.org/2025-December/005945.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e[License-review] [3rd Resubmission] ModelGo Zero License (MG0-2.0) AND...\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\n\n  \u003c/article\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"onebox-metadata\"\u003e\n    \n    \n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv style=\"clear: both\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eSince then, I have sent a few follow-up emails asking whether there were still open concerns or any next steps, including on Jan 27, May 26, and most recently on July 26, 2026:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://lists.opensource.org/pipermail/license-review_lists.opensource.org/2026-July/006124.html\"\u003e\n  \u003cheader class=\"source\"\u003e\n\n      \u003ca href=\"https://lists.opensource.org/pipermail/license-review_lists.opensource.org/2026-July/006124.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003elists.opensource.org\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/header\u003e\n\n  \u003carticle class=\"onebox-body\"\u003e\n    \n\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://lists.opensource.org/pipermail/license-review_lists.opensource.org/2026-July/006124.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e[License-review] [3rd Resubmission] ModelGo Zero License (MG0-2.0) AND...\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\n\n  \u003c/article\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"onebox-metadata\"\u003e\n    \n    \n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv style=\"clear: both\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eI have not seen any replies so far, so I wanted to check here in case the emails were missed, held for moderation, or possibly treated as spam. If they did reach the list normally, it would be helpful to know that too.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI understand that license review can take time, especially for something new like model licensing. I also understand that the OSI community and review team are busy, and I really appreciate the feedback that has already been given. At the same time, the review has been quiet for quite a while, so I would be grateful for any update on whether MG0-2.0 and MG-BY-2.0 are still under review, and whether there are any remaining issues I should address.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks,\u003cbr\u003e\nMoming\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-28T08:51:00.351Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":98,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":505.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":1441,"topic_slug":"question-about-the-modelgo-license-review-status","display_username":"Moming Duan","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://lists.opensource.org/pipermai